  "text": "QR ADMIN\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nBrowse workspace\nQR ORDERING / LIVE OPERATIONS\nService Requests\n\nRespond to table requests and keep your floor team in sync.\n\nEnabled\nQR table service requests\nRefresh\n\nShared with this branch's QR Admin, POS and Captain. Status is recovered from the server every 5 seconds. All current requests and the latest 200 history entries are included.\n\nPENDING\nALL\nOPEN\nACKNOWLEDGED\nIN_PROGRESS\nCOMPLETED\nCANCELLED\nEXPIRED\n\nNo pending service requests.\n\nService request settings\nEnable customer table requests\nTable cooldown (seconds)\nOverdue after (minutes)\nExpire after (minutes)\nRequest buttons\nRemove\nRemove\nRemove\nRemove\nRemove\nRemove\nAdd request type\n\nRequests remain in the inbox through quiet hours; staff can recover them after reconnecting. Alerts here are visual, with no external messages or alarm sounds.\n\nQuiet hours\nSave settings",
